# Who must approve a pull request. The rule on main requires code-owner review
# but 0 approvals, so a pull request that only touches paths without an owner
# can be merged by its author once the checks pass. The last matching line wins.

# Everything else (layouts, legal pages, config, scripts, workflows, Docker): admins
*                       @semantic-systems/website-admins

# Content: no owner, the author merges after the checks pass
/_team/
/_posts/
/_projects/
/_demos/
/_publications/
/assets/images/
/assets/icons/

# Except: the fetcher state and the templates stay with the admins
/_publications/.state.json                  @semantic-systems/website-admins
